Package: sensfamily
Type: Package
Title: Sensitivity Analysis Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/sensfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/sensfamily/issues
Description: Sensitivity analysis for linear regression estimates in jamovi: the
    robustness value and benchmark bounds for omitted variable bias (Cinelli and
    Hazlett, 2020) and the coefficient stability bounds of Oster (2019).
